<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>03 · 应用与交付</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>云购生活 · 第 5 周综合答辩</Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 6 }}>预测与问答：结果都必须可复核</Text>

    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 18 }} />

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 36 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 560, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>7 天 GMV 预测</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>滚动留出最后 28 天做测试，三条朴素基线做对照</Text>

            <Table
                style={{ width: '100%', height: 190, marginTop: 12 }}
                defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', textAlign: 'left' }}
                defaultCellStyle={{
                    border: {
                        left: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
                        right: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
                        top: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
                        bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' },
                    },
                    padding: { top: 7, bottom: 7, left: 12, right: 12 },
                }}
                cells={[
                    [
                        { text: '模型', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
                        { text: 'MAPE', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
                        { text: 'MAE（元）', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#1E4FA8' } } },
                    ],
                    ['基线 · 上周同日', '18.91%', '18,723.73'],
                    [
                        { text: '基线 · 近 7 日均值', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                        { text: '13.93%', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                        { text: '13,584.32', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F7F9FC' } } },
                    ],
                    ['线性回归', '11.55%', '12,121.66'],
                    [
                        { text: '随机森林（选用）', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0E3F8C' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                        { text: '11.79%', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0E3F8C' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                        { text: '12,038.70', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#0E3F8C' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                    ],
                ]}
            />

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10 }}>
                两个模型 MAPE 只差 0.24 个百分点，最终按 MAE 选型；7 天预测均值偏离历史均值仅 1.50%，无漂移。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>NL2SQL 的四条防线</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>提问 → 生成 SQL → 校验 → 执行 → 自修复</Text>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, marginTop: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 20 }}>①</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, flex: 1 }}>提示词约束：只允许单条 SELECT，禁止 DDL / DML</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 20 }}>②</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, flex: 1 }}>静态校验：表名白名单、危险关键字、强制 LIMIT</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 20 }}>③</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, flex: 1 }}>执行期自修复：报错回灌模型改一次，界面标注「已自修复」</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 20 }}>④</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, flex: 1 }}>无 Key 兜底：降级为规则匹配，并如实显示「规则兜底」</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, padding: '14px 16px', background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 4, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568' }}>实测：「2024 年 6 月的 GMV 是多少？」</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 6 }}>2,829,996.31</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 4 }}>4.2 秒完成，返回值与手工核算一致</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 16, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>云购生活数据仓库项目组</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>12</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
